# output/ holds hundreds of MB of regenerable artifacts (VTK, animations, ensemble plots).
# Keep only the comparison figures the README embeds. Note this must be `output/*`, not
# `output/`: an excluded directory is never descended into, so the negations below would
# not be reachable.
output/*
!output/dizon_mf6rtm_vs_obs.png
!output/dizon_mf6rtm_vs_pht3d.png
